+ * The previous implementation queried the parent MLD interface (e.g.
+ * "wlan16mld1") with the MLD MAC and tried to parse a vendor-specific nested
+ * "per-link info" attribute inside NL80211_ATTR_STA_INFO, using a guessed
+ * attribute ID (31) and a guessed sub-attribute schema. On this kernel/driver
+ * build, that attribute's sub-fields are always zero, so every affiliated
+ * link collapsed into a single bogus zero-MAC map entry, and both real
+ * affiliated links fell through to the same fallback RCPI.
