- * This is the same approach `iw dev wlan1_link0 station get <link_mac>` uses.
+ * Instead, each affiliated link is queried directly: its own per-link BSS
+ * interface (agent_db.h sBssid::iface_name, NOT the parent MLD interface) for
+ * its own affiliated STA MAC, reusing bwl::nl80211_client::get_sta_info() —
